    <td>Static PDF / Almanac charts</td>
    <td>Static day-count calendar</td>
    <td>Basic GDD tracking</td>
    <td><strong>Dynamic Autonomous Recalculation (Soil + GDD + Weather)</strong></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Hardware Cost</strong></td>
