<h2>11. Commercialization Status</h2>
<p>
  <strong>Corporate Structure:</strong> Incorporated as an early-stage deep-tech entity (<em>AgriPulse Innovations Pvt. Ltd.</em>, DPIIT Startup Recognition in progress, incubated at GCET).<br>
  <strong>Traction & MoUs:</strong>
</p>
<ul>
  <li>Signed bilateral Technology Trial Memorandums of Understanding (MoUs) with <strong>3 registered Farmer Producer Organizations (FPOs)</strong> in Telangana and Andhra Pradesh, providing immediate pilot coverage over 1,450 hectares and 820 farming households.</li>
  <li>Revenue Model: <strong>Hybrid HaaS (Hardware-as-a-Service) & SaaS</strong>:
    <ul>
      <li>FPO / Cooperative Plan: INR 499/acre/crop cycle for full automated sensor leasing, scheduling, and vernacular voice advisories.</li>
      <li>Free App Tier: Offline disease detection and standard crop calendar accessible at zero cost to any individual smallholder farmer.</li>
      <li>Carbon Verification API: B2B licensing fee from carbon registries for verified soil moisture and reduced nitrous oxide fertilizer emissions.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

